# BuildKit uses this file (mayhem/Dockerfile.dockerignore) in preference to the root
# .dockerignore when building with -f mayhem/Dockerfile. This additive override ensures
# .git is NOT excluded — the commit image must carry the full .git history for the
# grader / PATCH tier (§6.2 item 2).
#
# Exclude build artifacts to keep the context lean, but KEEP .git.
target/
hfuzz_*/
